{"3985850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kona & SnowRabbit", "steam_appid": 3985850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kona &amp; Sn</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985850/extras/271833612037c9d43be18864fe60481e.avif?t=1787059870\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985850/extras_big/271833612037c9d43be18864fe60481e.webp?t=1787059870 width=1560 height=877 /></span><strong>owRabbit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nicknamed <i>“the troublemakers of the art world,”</i> the rookie ice art duo Kona and SnowRabbit quickly rise to fame by pulling pranks on veteran artists. But their fame does not last long as the furious <i>Palette Gang</i> strikes back and turns their home into chaos. To reclaim their stolen artworks, comics, and pride, the two mischievous artists head for the gang’s exhibition hall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985850/extras/220b397d6b8c5fcbb9f36d3b52e42411.avif?t=1787059870\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985850/extras_big/220b397d6b8c5fcbb9f36d3b52e42411.webp?t=1787059870 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool and Thrilling &quot;Freeze Action&quot; Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, freeze, and smash. Enjoy fast and exhilarating battles that let you sweep through waves of enemies using simple and intuitive controls. Freeze your foes and shatter them with style in this uniquely satisfying freeze action experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985850/extras/ca4eb298015130be9d8f3af4376bfc4f.avif?t=1787059870\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985850/extras_big/ca4eb298015130be9d8f3af4376bfc4f.webp?t=1787059870 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stylish Characters and Comic Book Presentation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the mischievous ice artist duo to the talkative snow rabbit, colorful characters bring humor and charm to every scene. Speech bubbles, exaggerated expressions, and lively comic style effects create a vibrant playable comic atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985850/extras/8087a3deb58f1b237cf64be172d10c82.avif?t=1787059870\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985850/extras_big/8087a3deb58f1b237cf64be172d10c82.avif?t=1787059870 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chapters Filled with Distinctive Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter features a boss inspired by a unique art theme, set within their own exhibition hall. Every confrontation offers fresh challenges, creative designs, and memorable moments that showcase the duo’s frozen artistry.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kona &amp; Sn</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985850/extras/271833612037c9d43be18864fe60481e.avif?t=1787059870\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985850/extras_big/271833612037c9d43be18864fe60481e.webp?t=1787059870 width=1560 height=877 /></span><strong>owRabbit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nicknamed <i>“the troublemakers of the art world,”</i> the rookie ice art duo Kona and SnowRabbit quickly rise to fame by pulling pranks on veteran artists. But their fame does not last long as the furious <i>Palette Gang</i> strikes back and turns their home into chaos. To reclaim their stolen artworks, comics, and pride, the two mischievous artists head for the gang’s exhibition hall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985850/extras/220b397d6b8c5fcbb9f36d3b52e42411.avif?t=1787059870\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985850/extras_big/220b397d6b8c5fcbb9f36d3b52e42411.webp?t=1787059870 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool and Thrilling &quot;Freeze Action&quot; Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, freeze, and smash. Enjoy fast and exhilarating battles that let you sweep through waves of enemies using simple and intuitive controls. Freeze your foes and shatter them with style in this uniquely satisfying freeze action experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985850/extras/ca4eb298015130be9d8f3af4376bfc4f.avif?t=1787059870\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985850/extras_big/ca4eb298015130be9d8f3af4376bfc4f.webp?t=1787059870 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stylish Characters and Comic Book Presentation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the mischievous ice artist duo to the talkative snow rabbit, colorful characters bring humor and charm to every scene. Speech bubbles, exaggerated expressions, and lively comic style effects create a vibrant playable comic atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985850/extras/8087a3deb58f1b237cf64be172d10c82.a